xt_entities`` lists the codex entries RAG grounded the check on (empty\nwhen RAG was skipped / unconfigured \u2014 the check then ran on the scene text\nalone).", "properties": {"context_entities": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContextEntity"}, "title": "Context Entities", "type": "array"}, "warnings": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContinuityWarning"}, "title": "Warnings", "type": "array"}}, "title": "ContinuityResult", "type": "object"}, "ContinuityWarning": {"description": "One structured continuity finding (B3).\n\n``severity`` is one of info/warning/error (validated + clamped service-side,\nbut kept a free ``str`` on the wire so a future severity still renders).\n``message`` is the Hungarian description; ``entity`` is the affected Codex\nentity name, or ``None``.", "properties": {"entity": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Entity"}, "message": {"title": "Message", "type": "string"}, "severity": {"title": "Severity", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["severity", "message"], "title": "ContinuityWarning", "type": "object"}, "DescribeRequest": {"properties": {"channels": {"anyOf": [{"items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Channels"}, "max_tokens": {"anyOf": [{"maximum": 32768.0, "minimum": 1.0, "type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Max Tokens"}, "model": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Model"}, "scene_id": {"anyOf": [{"format": "uuid", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Scene Id"}, "selected_text": {"title": "Selected Text", "type": "string"}, "temperature": {"anyOf": [{"maximum": 2.0, "minimum": 0.0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Temperature"}}, "required": ["selected_text"], "title": "DescribeRequest", "type": "object"}, "GenerateSceneRequest": {"properties": {"beats": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Beats", "type": "array"}, "characters": {"default": "", "title": "Characters", "type": "string"}, "location